6.3 Referential Integrity
Every moderator.effect_id must exist in psychological_effect.

Every boundary_condition.effect_id must exist in psychological_effect.

Every replication.effect_id must exist in psychological_effect.

Every effect_relation.effect_id and effect_relation.related_effect_id must exist in psychological_effect.

Every work_link.effect_id must exist in psychological_effect.

Every replication_tracker_link.effect_id must exist in psychological_effect.

Every full_pipeline_link.effect_id must exist in psychological_effect.

