Validation 2. Referential integrity.

Validation 3. Version chain acyclicity.

Validation 4. Work resolution.

Validation 5. Replication tracker record resolution.

Validation 6. Full-pipeline result resolution.

Validation 7. Null-model result resolution.

Validation 8. Verification result resolution.

Validation 9. Provenance completeness.

Validation 10. Audit completeness.

Validation 11. Moderation completeness.

Validation 12. Effect size consistency. The effect sizes must be consistent with the units.

Validation 13. Replication status consistency. The replication status must be consistent with the replication outcomes.

Validation 14. Meta-analysis consistency. The meta-analytic effect size must be consistent with the individual studies.

